// ==================================================================
// MEMORY LAB - an educational explainer template (landscape 1920x1080)
// Topic: why we forget, and the two habits that beat the forgetting
//        curve (spaced repetition + active recall).
// Structure: Hook > Evidence > Technique 1 > Technique 2 > Method >
//            Plan > Recap > Learner challenge   (8 scenes, ~2 min)
//
// HOW TO REUSE THIS TEMPLATE
//  1. Keep the SLOTS: series tag (top-left), headline + gold underline,
//     one main visual, one footnote with the source, progress bar (bottom).
//  2. Swap the words inside TEXT "..." and SAY "..." for your own lesson.
//  3. Swap ICON names (any Lucide name the app knows, e.g. "rocket").
//  4. Palette lives in 6 colors: stage #0E1726, card #16233A, ink #F4F1EA,
//     muted #9FB2CE, gold #FFC857 (emphasis), teal #3DDBD9 (good),
//     coral #FF6B6B (problem). Find/replace to re-theme.
//  5. Update the "NN / 08" counter in each tag and the progress bar if you
//     add or remove scenes.
//  6. Keep every SAY about 2.6 words per second and avoid repeating the
//     on-screen words, so narration adds a reason, not an echo.
// ==================================================================
VERSION 1.0
CANVAS 1920 1080
BACKGROUND #0E1726
BOARD plain
STYLE clean
FONT neat
STROKE 3

